OL,3,GNEWSAMan did not care if woman was
OL,4,Adrunk, rape trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilkins is on trial at Winchester Crown
OL,7,FCourt with Norman Macksoni, 48, Connor
OL,8,FSanderson-Doyle, 32, and Mohammed
OL,9,FHassan, 38. They all deny sexual
OL,10,Foffences against Joanne, who has waived
OL,11,Fher right to anonymity.
OL,13,FProsecutor Sarah Jones KC said Wilkins
OL,14,Fhad invented his claim that he
OL,15,Fexpressed concerns about Joanne after
OL,16,FYoung said she may be drunk during his
OL,17,Fvisit.
